<title>INDIA: India ruling alliance sets Apr 9 budget vote talks.</title>
<headline>India ruling alliance sets Apr 9 budget vote talks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's ruling United Front alliance said on Monday it will hold talks with major political parties on April 9 to seek a way to salvage the budget for 1997/98 (April-March) from the country's political turmoil.</p>
</text>
